{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Ten is a medium-length single-player adventure game. You play as a young man who returns to a small town to his parents to restore an old church. Talk to the townspeople and help them. Help your father remember his past.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game mainly consists of dialogues and simple puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Ten takes about 4 hours to complete.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game interface is minimalistic and does not distract from the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Graphics with an emphasis on realism and VR will help you fully immerse yourself in the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are few locations in the game, and the main plot takes place in one small town. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In The Ten, you cannot lose or die.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Ten is created for reflection and calm long dialogues, and not for action.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Ten is a game about getting to know God and the importance of following his Commandments.</p>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3427130?t=1741892422","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427130/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1741892422","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427130/f47d9e49252220bea76270a3de3e3bc1af5153e4/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1741892422","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427130/f47d9e49252220bea76270a3de3e3bc1af5153e4/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1741892422","categories":[{"description":"Single-player","id":2},{"description":"VR Only","id":54},{"description":"Family Sharing","id":62}],"content_descriptors":{"ids":[],"notes":null},"detailed_description":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Ten is a medium-length single-player adventure game. You play as a young man who returns to a small town to his parents to restore an old church. Talk to the townspeople and help them. Help your father remember his past.</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">This game mainly consists of dialogues and simple puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Ten takes about 4 hours to complete.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The game interface is minimalistic and does not distract from the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">Graphics with an emphasis on realism and VR will help you fully immerse yourself in the game.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">There are few locations in the game, and the main plot takes place in one small town. </p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">In The Ten, you cannot lose or die.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Ten is created for reflection and calm long dialogues, and not for action.</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\">The Ten is a game about getting to know God and the importance of following his Commandments.</p>","developers":["Reform.media"],"genres":[{"description":"Adventure","id":"25"}],"header_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3427130/header.jpg?t=1741892422","is_free":false,"linux_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"mac_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>","recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"></ul>"},"movies":[{"highlight":true,"id":257114153,"mp4":{"480":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257114153/movie480.mp4?t=1741892420","max":"http://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/257114153/movie_max.mp4?t=1741892420"},"name":"Islands","thumbnail":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257114153/c54825c2f0b6cd236e5f18f5a8d9b72f9f966116/movie_600x337.jp